<title>FRANCE: Ecia 1997 Q1 sales rise 0.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Ecia 1997 Q1 sales rise 0.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 2,448    vs    2,446</p>
